OL,3,GNEWSACommunity green space no longer
OL,4,Apart of local plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners fighting to save a
OL,7,Fcommunity garden said they have
OL,8,F"breathed a sigh of relief" after the
OL,9,Fcouncil dropped plans to build homes on
OL,10,Fthe site.
OL,12,FForty-eight homes were earmarked for a
OL,13,Fplot that included the Green Backyard
OL,14,Fon London Road, Peterborough, under
OL,15,FPeterborough City Council's draft local
OL,16,Fplan to help meet housing targets.
OL,18,FThe local plan, a statutory blueprint
OL,19,Ffor future development in the city, is
OL,20,Fdue to go before the cabinet on Tuesday
OL,21,Fand no longer includes the site.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
