OL,3,GNEWSACommunity green space no longer
OL,4,Apart of local plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FLewis Vernum, a trustee of charity the
OL,7,FGreen Backyard, said: "We've had a huge
OL,8,Famount of support and the Green
OL,9,FBackyard has become something of an
OL,10,Ficon for the city. It would have been
OL,11,Fsilly to lose it to housing."
